@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folders/
actor "The client ." as Client
participant "Controller is RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nFOLDER + USER_FOLDER_BINDING" as DB
queue "It 's a transaction . outbox" as OUT
queue "Typed projection task" as TASK
participant "The worker pool ." as WORKER
database "The public events repository" as EVENT
participant "The controller . WebSocket" as DISP
participant "Signed client" as WS
Client -> API: POST JSON the folder
note right of API
  Creating a custom rule created
  The system folder rule/type is fixed and not manually created
  Automatically FOLDER_ITEM: active USER_STREAM_BINDING + It 's canonical . STREAM.is_archived = false
  All chats = All of them .; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false
end note
API -> DB: BEGIN; I want to insert FOLDER + user-defined binding
API -> OUT: I 'm going to add folder.created
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 201 JSON the folder
OUT -> TASK: immutable folder_projection(outbox_event_uuid)\nscope=user-folder; without coalescing
TASK -> WORKER: claim user-folder(project,user,folder)\nlease + fencing
WORKER -> DB: Read the last folder + bind
group One . worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> DB: ensure snapshot=[] + zero counts + version/updated_at
  WORKER -> EVENT: ready folder.created + unique effect guard
end
DISP -> EVENT: read/repeat/play
DISP -> WS: folder.created
@enduml
